# Roadwarrior client/server configuration templates: installed to
# --with-templatesdir (usr/share/racoon/templates, not under
# usr/share/doc/racoon) specifically so they survive on minimal/
# container installs that configure dpkg to strip /usr/share/doc/* --
# see docs/examples/Makefile.am and configure.ac's --with-templatesdir
# for the full reasoning. debian/rules' override_dh_installexamples
# deliberately excludes docs/examples/roadwarrior from its own docdir
# glob to avoid shipping a second, stale copy here.
